{"unit_id":"fuxin123z__dsh-skill-manage#card-zh","repo":"fuxin123z/dsh-skill-manage","commit":"cc2e84b8d35c3016a99b9a108021342869ce26e5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-manage 是面向 DSH 的技能管理插件，通过注册 skill_manage 工具和系统提示词中的技能纪律段落，让 agent 在会话中维护可热加载的流程技能。工具支持创建、补丁修改、完整编辑、列出、禁用或启用、固定或取消固定技能，并管理受限目录中的辅助文件；删除仅允许带 agent 创建标记且未固定的技能。技能可保存于用户级或项目级目录，适合希望把已验证工作流程沉淀为可复用技能的 DSH 使用者。插件从 DSH_HOME 或主目录定位用户技能目录，不需要外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:550-566","index.js:568-635","index.js:637-654"]}
{"unit_id":"fuxin123z__dsh-skill-manage#card-en","repo":"fuxin123z/dsh-skill-manage","commit":"cc2e84b8d35c3016a99b9a108021342869ce26e5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-skill-manage gives DSH agents a skill_manage tool for creating, updating, listing, disabling, pinning, and deleting reusable skills. Skills use user or project storage and are hot-loaded by the host. Deletion checks ownership and pin state.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:550-566","index.js:568-635","index.js:637-654"]}
