{"unit_id":"fuxin123z__dsh-skill-manage#feature-1","repo":"fuxin123z/dsh-skill-manage","commit":"cc2e84b8d35c3016a99b9a108021342869ce26e5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-manage 的功能「创建技能」：校验技能名称、YAML frontmatter 和内容长度后创建 SKILL.md，并补入 agent 创建标记；写入后可由宿主热加载。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:297-318"]}
{"unit_id":"fuxin123z__dsh-skill-manage#feature-2","repo":"fuxin123z/dsh-skill-manage","commit":"cc2e84b8d35c3016a99b9a108021342869ce26e5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-manage 的功能「修改技能」：可用唯一文本补丁更新主文件或允许目录中的辅助文件，也可完整重写 SKILL.md；主文件修改会再次校验 frontmatter 和名称。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:320-357","index.js:360-380"]}
{"unit_id":"fuxin123z__dsh-skill-manage#feature-3","repo":"fuxin123z/dsh-skill-manage","commit":"cc2e84b8d35c3016a99b9a108021342869ce26e5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-manage 的功能「管理启用与固定状态」：disable/enable 切换模型调用标记，pin/unpin 切换固定标记；这些操作保留技能其余内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:480-515","index.js:627-630"]}
{"unit_id":"fuxin123z__dsh-skill-manage#feature-4","repo":"fuxin123z/dsh-skill-manage","commit":"cc2e84b8d35c3016a99b9a108021342869ce26e5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-manage 的功能「列出和删除技能」：list 汇总用户与项目范围的技能及其状态；delete 会检查 agent 创建标记、固定状态和目录位置后再删除。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:383-400","index.js:438-478","index.js:608-618"]}
{"unit_id":"fuxin123z__dsh-skill-manage#caveat-1","repo":"fuxin123z/dsh-skill-manage","commit":"cc2e84b8d35c3016a99b9a108021342869ce26e5","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-manage 会在本机用户技能目录或项目根目录下的 .dsh/skills 中创建、改写和删除技能文件；用户级目录由 DSH_HOME 指定，未设置时使用主目录下的 .dsh。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:63-66","index.js:91-99","index.js:316-317","index.js:398"]}
